  "description": "A selection of Hell Camp short stories produced by legendary writers Lee Hyeon-Se and Lee Du-Ho! Introducing the strongest rookies of 2024!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)\n\n*Stories Included:*\n1. **Return Reaper** (리턴리퍼) \\[Gyojin\\]\n2. **Ni Namchin Jinaganda!** (니 남친 지나간다!) \\[8-cheokkeosin\\]\n3. **Du Beonjjae Gyeoureul Manna** (두 번째 겨울을 만나) \\[Gamja Cake\\]\n4. **1700-doui Hoheup** (1700도의 호흡) \\[PARANSON\\]\n5. **Neoneun Ace-jana!** (너는 에이스잖아!) \\[Daenamujangseung\\]\n6. **Dear My Brother** (Dear My Brother) \\[Gomanoera\\]\n7. **Jaya-ui Sowon** (자야의 소원) \\[Sinseon\\]\n8. **BossBABY** (보스BABY) \\[Ga-Hui Mun\\]\n9. **Apro** (앞으로) \\[- 2°C\\]\n10. **Gaeguri Rhapsody** (개구리 랩소디) \\[Eunhae\\]\n11. **Uri Jim Dalpaengi Chonggang-nim!** (우리 집 달팽이 총각님!) \\[Jjanggyul\\]\n12. **Jeom Jeom Jeom** (점점점) \\[Hongla\\]\n13. **Ppijukppijuk** (삐죽삐죽) \\[Yangppu\\]\n14. **Mangdol On Stage** (망돌 온스테이지) \\[Yu-Jin Sin\\]\n15. **Yeouijureul Chajajuseyong** (여의주를 찾아주세용) \\[Su-Han Yu\\]\n16. **Yeonkkocheomi** (연꽃어미) \\[Dam-Cho Seo\\]\n17. **Ttalgiuyu** (딸기우유) \\[Miryeongomtaengi\\]\n18. **Geu Namjaneun Yeongjeongsajineul Jjingneunda** (그 남자는 영정사진을 찍는다) \\[Bae\\]\n19. **Doraoneun Geoseun** (돌아오는 것은) \\[2-Yeonseung\\]\n20. **Cheonsangyeojagodeunghakgyo** (천상여자고등학교) \\[Han-Jun\\]",
